# 听语平台批 REST Client 调试样例 (2026-08-18)
# 变量约定同本目录其余文件: {{base}} / {{jwt}} / App 签名三件套由客户端中间件生成。
@base = http://localhost:9999
@jwt = Bearer <token>

### 1. 分片直传 init (P-5′)
POST {{base}}/v1/uploads/multipart/init
Authorization: {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mime_type": "audio/mpeg",
  "size": 20971520,
  "filename": "meeting.mp3",
  "content_type": "audio",
  "file_hash": "<sha256-64-hex>"
}

### 2. 分片签名 (逐片重复; PUT 后记录响应头 ETag)
POST {{base}}/v1/uploads/multipart/sign-part
Authorization: {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bid": "<init 返回 bid>", "part_number": 1 }

### 3. 合并完成 (响应同 finalize, 得 uploaded 资产)
POST {{base}}/v1/uploads/multipart/complete
Authorization: {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "bid": "<bid>", "parts": [ { "part_number": 1, "etag": "\"abc\"" }, { "part_number": 2, "etag": "\"def\"" } ] }

### 4. 整段转写提交 (transcript_v1; 预览切片改 pipeline_code=transcript_preview_v1)
POST {{base}}/v1/tasks
Authorization: {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pipeline_code": "transcript_v1",
  "params": {
    "audio_asset_bid": "<uploaded 音频资产 bid>",
    "language_hints": ["zh"],
    "diarization_enabled": true,
    "speaker_count": 4
  },
  "idempotency_key": "cli-demo-1"
}

### 5. 轮询产物 (终态 output_metadata.refs.transcript_asset_bid)
GET {{base}}/v1/tasks/<task_bid>
Authorization: {{jwt}}

### 6. 纪要衍生 (transcript_derive; kind 闭集见 capability.md)
POST {{base}}/v1/capabilities/transcript_derive/invoke
Authorization: {{jwt}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "input": {
    "kind": "minutes",
    "template": "standard",
    "transcript_asset_bid": "<refs.transcript_asset_bid>",
    "language": "zh"
  }
}

### 7. 月度免费额度领取 (P-6; 零请求体, identity 全 ctx)
POST {{base}}/v1/iap/free-quota/claim
Authorization: {{jwt}}

### 8. 转写正文检索 (knowledge 既有读面; KB 名 echonote:transcripts:{account_bid})
# 先 GET /v1/knowledge-bases 找到 kb_bid, 再:
# POST {{base}}/v1/knowledge-bases/retrieve {"kb_bids":["<kb_bid>"],"question":"价格 异议","top_k":5}
